{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39296","headline":"桐庐县作 · 韦庄","name":"桐庐县作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钱塘江尽到桐庐，水碧山青画不如。\n白羽鸟飞严子濑，绿蓑人钓季鹰鱼。\n潭心倒影时开合，谷口闲云自卷舒。\n此境只应词客爱，投文空吊木玄虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}